GHOST ADMIN API — ROUTE CATALOG
Snapshot of the official main branch: 45498ed2eca0585e3542c852e57b275581a78d63
Updated: 2026-11-01

Scope: 253 canonical Admin API routes in 54 groups from this pinned Ghost commit.
Includes internal and experimental routes; availability depends on version, role and feature flags.
This is a route inventory, not a complete payload schema. Usage and safety: README.md.

Sources:
  Docs: https://docs.ghost.org/admin-api
  Docs index: https://docs.ghost.org/llms.txt
  R: https://github.com/TryGhost/Ghost/blob/45498ed2eca0585e3542c852e57b275581a78d63/ghost/core/server/web/api/endpoints/admin/routes.js
  Permissions: https://github.com/TryGhost/Ghost/blob/45498ed2eca0585e3542c852e57b275581a78d63/ghost/core/server/web/api/endpoints/admin/middleware.js

Legend:
  [doc] explicit method/path in public docs; [src] confirmed in source, not explicitly documented.
  [I] passes the integration-token allowlist; handler permissions and other checks still apply.
  [U] staff token or user session required; integration tokens blocked.
  [SESSION] user cookie session required; staff and integration tokens blocked.
  [FLOW] login/recovery/setup with special authentication; [PUBLIC] unauthenticated site info.
  R:N = line N in source R; handler = Ghost API handler; MCP=name = dedicated tool, MCP=no = none.
  flag = router feature gate; upload = multipart file fields; token-url = URL-token auth middleware.
  These labels do not replace handler validation or indicate that session flows are implemented here.

Paths: prepend /ghost/api to catalog paths. For ghost_api_request, omit the /admin prefix.

COMPLETE ROUTE CATALOG

01. SITE — basic site information (routes: 1)
GET    /admin/site/  [doc] [PUBLIC] — get site title, description, logo, URL, and version
  handler=site.read; R:20; MCP=get_site

